flowchart TD
  v[pnpm version minor · git push --follow-tags] --> ci[CI · lint · type-check · test]
  ci --> d[Draft release]
  d --> u[Upload dmg · zip · latest-mac.yml]
  u --> y{latest-mac.yml present?}
  y -->|yes| pub[Publish]
  y -->|no| stay[Stays draft]
  pub --> app[Apps check 30 s after launch, then every 6 h]
